Modifications:
--------------
This is a substantially modified version of Paraglidable, including:

1. Migration from TensorFlow 1.15 to TensorFlow 2.15+
   - Updated all deprecated tf.keras.backend.* APIs to modern TensorFlow 2.x equivalents
   - Refactored custom Keras layers for TF 2.x compatibility
   - Updated model compilation and training code

2. Python version requirement updated to Python 3.12+
   - Removed support for older Python versions
   - Updated all dependencies to modern versions

3. Architecture simplification
   - Removed Docker-based deployment
   - Removed Apache/PHP web server components
   - Removed C++/Qt5 tile generator
   - Converted to CLI-first application using Typer

4. Project structure modernization
   - Adopted src/ layout with pyproject.toml
   - Reorganized code into logical modules
   - Added modern Python tooling (black, ruff, mypy, pytest)

5. Configuration management
   - Replaced environment detection with Pydantic Settings
   - Unified configuration through .env files

